ack\\\\else gray\\\\fi\\\\fi\\\\fi\\\\fi\\\\fi!\\\\ifnum#3<3 30\\\\else\\\\ifnum#3<5 70\\\\else 100\\\\fi\\\\fi!black}{\\\\text{[#1 (S#2/C#3)]}}\\\\else\\\\textcolor{\\\\ifnum#2=5 red\\\\else\\\\ifnum#2=4 orange\\\\else\\\\ifnum#2=3 yellow!80!red\\\\else\\\\ifnum#2=2 yellow!60!black\\\\else\\\\ifnum#2=0 green!60!black\\\\else gray\\\\fi\\\\fi\\\\fi\\\\fi\\\\fi!\\\\ifnum#3<3 30\\\\else\\\\ifnum#3<5 70\\\\else 100\\\\fi\\\\fi!black}{[#1 (S#2/C#3)]}\\\\fi}\\n\\nYour answer goes to the person who started the program: the main findings in a few sentences, most severe first.\",\"tools\":[\"read_file\",\"edit_file\",\"glob\",\"grep\",\"bash\"]}"}}');
